{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Vinterium is a challenging action roguelite set in a grim fantasy world, where survival depends not only on your click speed but also on your sharp wit. Engage in dynamic battles, solve tricky puzzles, and find magical artifact cards to empower your hero against the upcoming danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vinterium-infused undead, traps, and ruthless bosses will be waiting for a chance to kill you. Every run is unique: new crossroads and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/bd775bdefcae74ac67d08b7fa745f809.poster.avif?t=1761933379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/bd775bdefcae74ac67d08b7fa745f809.webm?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/bd775bdefcae74ac67d08b7fa745f809.mp4?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mix and Match</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your unique playstyle by combining empowerment cards. Combine abilities, empower your hero, and change the rules right in the middle of a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/b45d2c458be6ca3f045365e9275c4d5c.poster.avif?t=1761933379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/b45d2c458be6ca3f045365e9275c4d5c.webm?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/b45d2c458be6ca3f045365e9275c4d5c.mp4?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To proceed further, you'll have to not only defeat enemies but also solve mysteries \u2013 the source of new magical cards and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/edba386b9967bb2c9010adc204c4a6b3.poster.avif?t=1761933379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/edba386b9967bb2c9010adc204c4a6b3.webm?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/edba386b9967bb2c9010adc204c4a6b3.mp4?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice and every challenge leads to the climax. Whether you achieve your goal or fall like your predecessors, only you decide.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052030?t=1761933379","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052030?t=1761933379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/084ece4aaadca6cc986beadd1ce2a465d9ebaad6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761933379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/084ece4aaadca6cc986beadd1ce2a465d9ebaad6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761933379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Vinterium is a challenging action roguelite set in a grim fantasy world, where survival depends not only on your click speed but also on your sharp wit. Engage in dynamic battles, solve tricky puzzles, and find magical artifact cards to empower your hero against the upcoming danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vinterium-infused undead, traps, and ruthless bosses will be waiting for a chance to kill you. Every run is unique: new crossroads and new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/bd775bdefcae74ac67d08b7fa745f809.poster.avif?t=1761933379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/bd775bdefcae74ac67d08b7fa745f809.webm?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/bd775bdefcae74ac67d08b7fa745f809.mp4?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mix and Match</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your unique playstyle by combining empowerment cards. Combine abilities, empower your hero, and change the rules right in the middle of a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/b45d2c458be6ca3f045365e9275c4d5c.poster.avif?t=1761933379\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/b45d2c458be6ca3f045365e9275c4d5c.webm?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052030/extras/b45d2c458be6ca3f045365e9275c4d5c.mp4?t=1761933379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzles</h2><p c